o not skip minor versions or downgrade. This protects database\nmigrations and allows future cleanup of old migration code.\n\nRules enforced:\n- Same minor version: always allowed (patch changes either way)\n- Single minor upgrade (e.g. 0.27 -> 0.28): allowed\n- Multi-minor upgrade (e.g. 0.25 -> 0.28): blocked with guidance\n- Any minor downgrade: blocked\n- Major version change: blocked\n- Dev builds: warn but allow, preserve stored version\n\nThe version is stored in a purpose-built database_versions table\nafter migrations succeed. The table is created with raw SQL before\ngormigrate runs to avoid circular dependencies.\n\nUpdates #3058","parents":[{"sha":"ee0a878d36142b6f8eef1bcbc0cfe7f1899b6366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/ee0a878d36142b6f8eef1bcbc0cfe7f1899b6366","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/ee0a878d36142b6f8eef1bcbc0cfe7f1899b6366"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"fde054dbbabba208acb2cd934ab0146585ab9dc0","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGZkZTA1NGRiYmFiYmEyMDhhY2IyY2Q5MzRhYjAxNDY1ODVhYjlkYzA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/fde054dbbabba208acb2cd934ab0146585ab9dc0","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/fde054dbbabba208acb2cd934ab0146585ab9dc0","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-16T14:16:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-02-16T14:16:52Z"},"tree":{"sha":"9010b920b5882b0d4f4e2bd98cf99cc4f8b84f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/9010b920b5882b0d4f4e2bd98cf99cc4f8b84f72"},"message":"all: upgrade from Go 1.26rc2 to Go 1.26.0","parents":[{"sha":"aa0721efa307705c0d0706e3b76b1bdfc54fb618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/aa0721efa307705c0d0706e3b76b1bdfc54fb618","html_url":"https://github.